cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "dutch-streetname-reader"
abstract: >-
  Script that extracts Dutch street names from the BAG (Basisregistratie Adressen en Gebouwen) public-space extract published by Kadaster via PDOK, and normalises them into a reference list. The list is used for detecting addresses in the GitHub security infrastructure of the Amsterdam UMC.
